{"segs": ["PA_ja_197:0.1"], "en": "Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_197:0.2", "PA_ja_197:0.3"], "en": "The Second Book of Pairs, The Chapter on Ruhaka", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_197:0.4"], "en": "7. The Mittāmitta Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_197:1.1"], "en": "\"Seeing him, he does not smile;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_197:1.2"], "en": "nor does he greet him back.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_197:1.3", "PA_ja_197:1.4"], "en": "He does not give his eyes and behaves contrary [to expectations].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_197:2.1"], "en": "These are the signs that occur.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_197:2.2"], "en": "They stand as enemies;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_197:2.3"], "en": "by these signs a wise person should recognize an enemy,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_197:2.4"], "en": "both upon seeing and hearing them.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_197:3.1"], "en": "The Mittāmitta Jātaka, the seventh.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"}
]
